Bilinguator Aligner is a browser-based tool for creating bilingual books from parallel texts.

Version: {{VERSION}}

Usage:
    bilinguator_aligner [command | option]

Commands & Options:
    (no arguments)       Run the app
    --version, -v        Show app version
    --help, -h           Show this help message
    --uninstall          Remove the app